  "bulletin": {
    "id": "1504",
    "issue_date": "2026-11-28T12:15:00.000Z",
    "updated_at": "2026-11-28T10:59:38.896Z",
    "meteorologist": "Hari Dahal",
    "analysis_np": "हाल नेपालमा कुनै पनि मौसमी प्रणालीको उल्लेखनीय प्रभाव रहेको छैन ।",
    "analysis_en": "Currently, no significant weather system is influencing the country.",
    "today_np": "कोशी, मधेश, बागमती, गण्डकी र लुम्बिनी प्रदेशमा आंशिक बादल लाग्नेछ, बाँकी क्षेत्रमा मौसम मूख्यतया सफा रहनेछ।  बिहानपख उपत्यका र खोँचहरूका साथै तराई भू-भागका थोरै स्थानमा हुस्सु/कुहिरो लाग्नेछ ।",
    "today_en": "Partly cloudy conditions will prevail in Koshi, Madhesh, Bagmati, Gandaki and Lumbini Provinces, while the weather will remain mainly fair in the remaining areas. Mist/fog is likely at a few places in valleys and river basins, as well as in the Terai regions, during the early morning.",
    "tomorrow_np": "देशको हिमाली क्षेत्रमा साथै कोशी र बागमती प्रदेशका पहाडी क्षेत्रमा आंशिक बादल लाग्नेछ, बाँकी क्षेत्रमा मौसम मूख्यतया सफा रहनेछ। देशको हिमाली भू-भागको एक-दुई स्थानमा हल्का वर्षा/हिमपातको सम्भावना छ।",
    "tomorrow_en": "Partly cloudy conditions will prevail in the Himalayan regions of the country, as well as in the Hilly regions of Koshi and Bagmati Provinces, while the weather will remain mainly fair in the remaining areas.  Light rain/snowfall is likely at one or two places in the Himalayan regions of the country.",
    "special": ""
  },
